OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786114088
OL,3,CDowning Street vows to help pubs
OL,4,Cthrive amid 'vertical-drinking' row
OL,6,FIt came after he unveiled a packaged
OL,7,Fof support to reduce business rates by
OL,8,F20% for pubs, clubs and live music
OL,9,Fvenues across England from April 2027.
OL,11,F"The pubs that we've got are at the
OL,12,Fheart of high streets, and I think
OL,13,Fit's really important to signal at the
OL,14,Fstart of my time in office that I will
OL,15,Fbe a defender for them," he said. "I
OL,16,Fwill speak up for them and act."
OL,26,@sD@AOUwD@XO]wD@cOUxD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786114088
OL,3,CDowning Street vows to help pubs
OL,4,Cthrive amid 'vertical-drinking' row
OL,6,FBurnham has consistently said he
OL,7,Fenjoys pubs, even saying he would go
OL,8,Ffor a pint straight after his
OL,9,FMakerfield by-election win and made a
OL,10,Fvideo with chancellor John Healey on
OL,11,Fthe best pub snacks.
OL,13,FMayor of London Sadiq Khan has
OL,14,Fcriticised Westminster City Council's
OL,15,Fset of draft policies, writing on X:
OL,16,F"You can't run a world-famous
OL,17,Fnightlife district with a village-hall
OL,18,Fmindset."
OL,26,@xD@AOUzD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786114088
OL,3,CDowning Street vows to help pubs
OL,4,Cthrive amid 'vertical-drinking' row
OL,6,FResponding to this criticism Cllr
OL,7,FSwaddle said: "We don't need lectures
OL,8,Ffrom City Hall on backing hospitality
OL,9,Fwhen they have directed the police to
OL,10,Fobject to every new licence
OL,11,Fapplication as their solution to
OL,12,Fcurbing crime in the West End."
OL,14,FHe added: "Growth is central to
OL,15,Feverything this administration is
OL,16,Fdoing. That means backing our
OL,17,Fhospitality sector, not making things
OL,18,Fharder for them.
OL,26,@oD@OOUtD@_O]vD@KOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786114088
OL,3,CDowning Street vows to help pubs
OL,4,Cthrive amid 'vertical-drinking' row
OL,6,F"We approve well over 98% of licence
OL,7,Fapplications, we've just backed a 24-
OL,8,Fhour licence in the West End and a new
OL,9,Fpub in Covent Garden, and we've
OL,10,Flaunched our own campaign to get
OL,11,Fpeople back out enjoying Soho this
OL,12,Fsummer.
OL,14,F"That's growth that keeps this city
OL,15,Fopen for business."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOUwD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/15
