OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786114088
OL,3,CDowning Street vows to help pubs
OL,4,Cthrive amid 'vertical-drinking' row
OL,6,FThe proposed policy of curtailing
OL,7,Fvertical drinking in the West End has
OL,8,Fattracted criticism from business
OL,9,Fowners, including Lesley Lewis, who
OL,10,Fhas run Soho's French House pub for 37
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,13,F"We rely on those people standing up
OL,14,Fwith the rents and the rates put upon
OL,15,Fus," she said.
OL,26,@uD@AOUwD@DO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30611
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786114088
OL,3,CDowning Street vows to help pubs
OL,4,Cthrive amid 'vertical-drinking' row
OL,6,F"People want to enjoy themselves in
OL,7,FSoho, they want to have a drink
OL,8,Foutside, they want to dance, they
OL,9,Fdon't want to sit down and just be
OL,10,Fwhere they are, they want to meet
OL,11,Fpeople and chat."
