OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786114088
OL,3,CDowning Street vows to help pubs
OL,4,Cthrive amid 'vertical-drinking' row
OL,6,FMs Lewis warned the policies risked
OL,7,Fdriving customers to new watering
OL,8,Fholes in other London boroughs, such
OL,9,Fas Camden, which "are a bit more
OL,10,Fexciting and a bit more licence-
OL,11,Ffriendly".
OL,13,FA Soho Business Alliance spokesperson
OL,14,Fsaid: "I think they're trying to
OL,15,Freduce the capacities in these venues.
OL,16,FIt's been like that for years where
OL,17,Fpeople are standing and drinking, it's
OL,18,Fnot causing crime, it's not causing
OL,19,Fissues.
OL,26,@qD@ROUsD@IO]vD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30613
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786114088
OL,3,CDowning Street vows to help pubs
OL,4,Cthrive amid 'vertical-drinking' row
OL,6,F"It's them trying to change the nature
OL,7,Fof Soho and it's quite sad that
OL,8,Fthey've gone to such lengths to
OL,9,Fsanitise the area."
OL,11,F"They don't want the late-night
OL,12,Feconomy," the alliance added, claiming
OL,13,Fthe policy "completely contradicts"
OL,14,FKhan's This policy completely
OL,15,Fcontradicts City Hall's plan for the
OL,16,Fcapital.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUtD@IO]uD@LOUuD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/15
