PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786114088
OL,3,CDowning Street vows to help pubs
OL,4,Cthrive amid 'vertical-drinking' row
OL,6,FA Conservative Party spokesperson
OL,7,Fcalled for Westminster City Council to
OL,8,Fstrike a balance between the night-
OL,9,Ftime economy and concerns from
OL,10,Fneighbours.
OL,12,FThey said: "Standing inside or outside
OL,13,Fa pub with a pint in hand is a British
OL,14,Ftradition. We hope the council's
OL,15,Fconsultation will recognise its
OL,16,Fimportance, whilst addressing any
OL,17,Fparticular local issues in crowded
OL,18,Flate-night locations."
OL,26,@tD@LOUzD@VO]
